000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. OCCTEST.
000300 DATA DIVISION.
000400 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000500 01  YEARLY-TABLE.
000600     05  YEARLY-TOTALS OCCURS 5 TIMES.
000700         10  YT-DEBITS   PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
000800         10  YT-CREDITS  PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
000900 01  MONTH-DAYS.
001000     05  MD-ENTRY OCCURS 12 TIMES PIC 99 COMP.
001100 01  WS-IDX     PIC S9(4)   COMP VALUE 1.
001200 01  OUT-NUM    PIC 9(7)V99      VALUE 0.
001300 01  OUT-SMALL  PIC 9(4)         VALUE 0.
001400 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
001500 MAIN-PARA.
001600     MOVE 1 TO WS-IDX.
001700 FILL-LOOP.
001800     IF WS-IDX > 5 GO TO FILL-DONE.
001900     COMPUTE YT-DEBITS (WS-IDX) = WS-IDX * 100.
002000     COMPUTE YT-CREDITS (WS-IDX) = WS-IDX * 10.
002100     ADD 1 TO WS-IDX.
002200     GO TO FILL-LOOP.
002300 FILL-DONE.
002400     MOVE 3 TO WS-IDX.
002500     MOVE YT-DEBITS (WS-IDX) TO OUT-NUM.
002600     DISPLAY OUT-NUM.
002700     MOVE YT-CREDITS (WS-IDX) TO OUT-NUM.
002800     DISPLAY OUT-NUM.
002900     MOVE YT-DEBITS (5) TO OUT-NUM.
003000     DISPLAY OUT-NUM.
003100     COMPUTE OUT-NUM = YT-DEBITS (2) + YT-CREDITS (4).
003200     DISPLAY OUT-NUM.
003300     MOVE 12 TO MD-ENTRY (1).
003400     MOVE 31 TO MD-ENTRY (12).
003500     MOVE MD-ENTRY (12) TO OUT-SMALL.
003600     DISPLAY OUT-SMALL.
003700     STOP RUN.
